// Dining Philosophers - Deadlock Reachability
//
// In the BUGGY model (model.prism):  result should be > 0 (deadlock reachable)
// In the CORRECT model (correct.prism): result should be 0 (deadlock impossible)
//
// "sbad" = all forks taken, no philosopher eating (same label as dining_philosophers_a)

P=? [ F "sbad" ]
